<view class="page safe-page"><view class="head"><view><view class="eyebrow">OUR MILESTONES</view><view class="title">值得记住的日子</view><view class="subtitle">时间会把普通日子，慢慢变成我们的故事。</view></view><button bindtap="create">＋</button></view><view wx:if="{{state==='loading'}}" class="notice">正在翻开纪念册…</view><view wx:elif="{{state==='error'}}" class="notice" bindtap="load">{{error}} · 点此重试</view><block wx:else><view wx:if="{{pinned.length}}" class="section-title">置顶纪念</view><anniversary-card wx:for="{{pinned}}" wx:key="id" item="{{item}}" bind:open="open" bind:edit="edit"/><view class="section-title">全部纪念日</view><anniversary-card wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" item="{{item}}" bind:open="open" bind:edit="edit"/><view wx:if="{{state==='empty'}}" class="empty">还没有纪念日。<text bindtap="create">记下第一个 ›</text></view></block></view>
